DP  - 2019 Mar
TI  - Characterizing the Biomedical Data-Sharing Landscape.
PG  - 21-30
LID - 10.1177/1073110519840481 [doi]
AB  - With a lens on genomic data, we present a typology characterizing the
      data-sharing landscape in biomedical research to advance understanding of the key
      stakeholders and existing data-sharing practices. Our typology highlights the
      diversity of data-sharing efforts and facilitators and reveals how novel
      data-sharing efforts are challenging existing norms regarding the role of
      individuals whom the data describe.
